// HybridConnectionManager Service Running | T1554 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/builtin/servicebus/win_hybridconnectionmgr_svc_running.yml
any where winlog.channel:"Microsoft-ServiceBus-Client" and ((event.code like~ ("40300", "40301", "40302")) and ("HybridConnection" or "sb://" or "servicebus.windows.net" or "HybridConnectionManage"))
